#: scenario:scenario_63B01B20_FFDA_4105_BCEF_4F9911C0B725
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4fe7ca8313ff83c44a2833f18dc2d3ec01aaab3d600fe110d110c1cf7f4092f0
#. default-sha256: 412dcb5d8b6d349427b28fddfc35f7f5d2c6afb960fe5cb9d429b4ef31046e79
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_63B01B20_FFDA_4105_BCEF_4F9911C0B725"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫“The mansion had an alluring air of beauty about it in that era;⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫it was "
"almost like something out of a fairy tale.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫「その時代、屋敷は空想のお伽噺のように芳しいものでした」"

#: scenario:scenario_D8C620F4_AD25_48DF_A912_D788A4C578D2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4020e9b32b66f791558b5c9c62142ea1485ffdcbaf6f48ad5cf91c5c0bb38295
#. default-sha256: eff9a7e3418a89518c4a4193cd044108bb1701dc80bb3ec00fb448313b504f2e
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D8C620F4_AD25_48DF_A912_D788A4C578D2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫This period of history could perhaps be described as a symphony of destruction, as "
"cumbersome principles of old came crashing down."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫重厚なる規律が崩壊するしらべというのは、⟪k:2⟫このことを言うのでしょう。"

#: scenario:scenario_483E424D_25A2_4B03_8534_36B2371F1FA3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b7378c0b1298ce3b518c1cfc25b0d8a8f18c70102d917e8958e01933a844aabf
#. default-sha256: 5da4fca4a7ed4ffdebd04015ecd9b51bcbe315fe80927a5dd0399989211dd898
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_483E424D_25A2_4B03_8534_36B2371F1FA3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Freed from the day-to-day oppression of these antiquated precepts, the people seemed to hark "
"back to the more poetic, expressive ways of old."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫人々は抑圧の日々から抜けだし、⟪k:1⟫忘れ去られていた古代の抒情さを取り戻すかのように、"

#: scenario:scenario_40443B05_EDC4_475C_BED6_60B08F7565D0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f2883b7bec4c269228d2ff3eaece14a17fb64b1458459e0136d5f8231504fc16
#. default-sha256: c8c15c1471a07804eff9c2728604343b1e5a27f76d89499cb945996557e1e4da
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_40443B05_EDC4_475C_BED6_60B08F7565D0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They took these newly blossoming emotions in hand, and with them they wrote literature, "
"painted portraits, composed theatre, and found love."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫その咲き誇る胸の内を文字に、⟪k:1⟫絵画に、⟪k:2⟫演劇に、⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫そして恋に使いました。"

#: scenario:scenario_CB4AB513_EC78_4644_B255_F6EB0C71B215
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 28cbd35f6534d3e590bb216294a4805e5b843c1bc06acb369f61dfdcea4d8df0
#. default-sha256: 50cbbad33461037aaa851516341a94873bd7002b54fc24519728cd7b717a8cfe
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_CB4AB513_EC78_4644_B255_F6EB0C71B215"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Even the Church, which had maintained authority throughout the Middle Ages, embraced the "
"changing times, adopting the culture’s flowering sense of aesthetic."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫中世時代に権威を掌握していた教会も、⟪k:1⟫時代の変遷を受け入れ、⟪k:2⟫文化の花開いた建築美を自"
"らのものに取り込みました。"

#: scenario:scenario_E2D63C37_8B1E_4480_9979_811ED8FC0CC5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 35ecb55db40461fc5bd95626eb912c58eb4c39d42f43b2546f05e347ef655fc7
#. default-sha256: d46795ef334d068e0da52bd90d12b1858e8f271e31699e81642ba05beba6ac7b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E2D63C37_8B1E_4480_9979_811ED8FC0CC5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫War would break out not twenty years from then, plucking the ripened era from the tree of "
"history—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫but that is of no concern to us now."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫熟しきったその時代は、⟪k:1⟫あと二十年もしない内に始まる戦によって手折られますが、⟪k:2⟫それは"
"少し先の話。"

#: scenario:scenario_FBF23873_677B_4F7E_90CB_56B4F9DEFC6E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2443dc5f7bfa0e6266fe125a5fccb655bc62a4aaa1040743f3c19e5f92049fc5
#. default-sha256: 67c9542bd69d81638b2e0b3785a85d4345d8e766e9ded33d36766c59522771e2
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_FBF23873_677B_4F7E_90CB_56B4F9DEFC6E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫At the time, it was still what people refer to as the Golden Age, a period of furor for all "
"who were there."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫その時はまだ黄金時代と謡われ、⟪k:1⟫人々の心を揺さぶるのでした。"

#: scenario:scenario_709FB765_6076_4326_9B5F_D37FB6CAD9F3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d97d0910cd20cdd870903bf7aa6e96944eb2ae658602e34420acc021b801a091
#. default-sha256: 287df8aea8282d684e10b9c2b1e8a2bcccd2ccaf39d280cb080f3091c5d17c32
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_709FB765_6076_4326_9B5F_D37FB6CAD9F3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Now, let us take a slight detour."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫少し寄り道をいたしましょう。"

#: scenario:scenario_BE59C5FE_F4DC_421A_9E7A_430A70556DE9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c3e4dd1ffcef3b9ca47135e2f61bf856c94d9a781fc62746142670976a5d09b8
#. default-sha256: 0b02841518ecd9e128cb649817ff6617449fa12406d5841ef989e875d215200e
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_BE59C5FE_F4DC_421A_9E7A_430A70556DE9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No, we will not be changing locations—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫this is a tale about the mansion, from "
"beginning to end. ⟪k:3⟫We ⟪k:4⟫will⟪k:5⟫, however, be moving through time. ⟪k:6⟫Say... ⟪k:7⟫about "
"eight years into the past."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫あら、⟪k:1⟫場所を移すのではありませんわ。⟪k:2⟫お話は、⟪k:3⟫ずっとお屋敷のこと。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫です"
"が、⟪k:6⟫時を……そうですね、⟪k:7⟫八年ばかり戻しましょう。"

#: scenario:scenario_9E3FFB8B_EAD7_43D7_A427_8C7BCE912ECA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 07cd13872588e47007a31f1e522aa8ddf79b05b86a908db8d8d56c386e80a50c
#. default-sha256: 5f9c92bf797452a2d5e132b4ea7d7e14be8238af0126e7a0725e03dcc6be7239
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_9E3FFB8B_EAD7_43D7_A427_8C7BCE912ECA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫A very wealthy family lived in the house then."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫屋敷にはとても裕福な一家が住んでおりました。"

#: scenario:scenario_1562B177_D703_447B_A77E_920C52C76F1E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9e1a410c57bf7244175f825007117704f7c9e00b19a56aa5b81e24755855fea8
#. default-sha256: 43cdfa28181a4e63bf82c8af87e757bafb4d068abc81c0a6f79ca5a58c16dfbf
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1562B177_D703_447B_A77E_920C52C76F1E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The mother and father, brother and sister all had distinctive, beautiful flaxen hair."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫一家の特徴は、⟪k:1⟫父も母も、⟪k:2⟫そして兄も妹も、⟪k:3⟫とても美しい亜麻色の髪をしていたという"
"ことです。"

#: scenario:scenario_20130EE8_E62A_48C8_AA1C_B8FAE8B6709E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3a4a9c60bb106b445b363620fe353c7f0f60074e4b1258f95b090bfd2cc8bc77
#. default-sha256: 63ecbd0f1efc06c90d758cf834ad7f528275354916d3b08446def83c21060e2b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_20130EE8_E62A_48C8_AA1C_B8FAE8B6709E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was always enamored by their hair.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫By contrast, mine is the color of a wet crow."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫わたくし、⟪k:1⟫あの方々の髪をいつだって見惚れておりましたわ。⟪k:2⟫わたくしの髪は真っ黒で、"
"⟪k:3⟫まるで濡れ烏のようなんですもの。"

#: scenario:scenario_C31CB050_5A68_4BE8_82E7_B6AB10BCE924
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 18f3bef48ca86ae4bad5785ae9bc9a18da01d65ed7c074e92ed1fa8b5feac6d9
#. default-sha256: 1bdf03af8ab56282cd6ebac92d0f17378952cb61a21c96e10bb9dfb2ef93937a
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_C31CB050_5A68_4BE8_82E7_B6AB10BCE924"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫See? There I am, standing around, looking rather a fool."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ほら、⟪k:1⟫あそこに呆けた間抜け面のわたくしがおりますでしょう？"

#: scenario:scenario_E938425F_E243_4D5B_91A5_736A9F4D674B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 266a4133fd57a2ffaa16b44da5b8e7340a1af917512bfe9d455af846f29d691c
#. default-sha256: 1bfcf601b8809223986f73a7ca4a79b39d8478c07acf8db9ad1aec2e59f97ce9
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E938425F_E243_4D5B_91A5_736A9F4D674B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was happy back then. ⟪k:1⟫And what reason did I have not to be, afforded the opportunity "
"to attend to such a beautiful home?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫わたくしは幸せでございました。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫何せこんなに美しい家族にお仕えできたのですから。"

#: scenario:scenario_3C0ADA2C_7EE6_4AD3_855F_93B525DFB7DD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ef5e720c6c976f3c1c1d162d2f3f006909e8b072b88ae79ab32604bf21c8645c
#. default-sha256: 0d987f23ac0ec8604ec9c09ac33d2a40bdc759c9c3563d26d373e971fb1804a4
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3C0ADA2C_7EE6_4AD3_855F_93B525DFB7DD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫So I poured my heart into serving that family."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫だから、⟪k:1⟫誠心誠意一家のお世話をさせていただきましたの。"

#: scenario:scenario_BB69FD67_0E0B_4E42_A52D_C46BE2D4A149
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b02a1d5d3993f0feb69f976601d94d5b991fd97e9d935ae20dd50f784bbb0011
#. default-sha256: 16ed96cdae0aaa46583cf129f21ddb38a92bb729c64b4f13afe853da8a1f6fad
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_BB69FD67_0E0B_4E42_A52D_C46BE2D4A149"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫...Listen closely, if you would. ⟪k:1⟫That soft, fleeting sound that could only be a young "
"girl singing—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫can you hear it?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫…………ほら、⟪k:1⟫耳をすまして。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫少女特有の、⟪k:4⟫はかなく、⟪k:5⟫柔らかい歌声が聞こえて"
"きませんか？"

#: scenario:scenario_17D4D6FE_C596_4A24_83F8_5EA3C565E1E9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3437f05519684d2c8467bbadf04cd9ba2116150558bef9451c101dd2c44be3b7
#. default-sha256: 20b72e3071683d37dd7ebb0a265c409d28284f58ebbd7aeed47fe3e18ea477bc
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_17D4D6FE_C596_4A24_83F8_5EA3C565E1E9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Lalalaa, ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫lalaalalaa..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫――♪⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　――……♪"

#: scenario:scenario_BCAEF6C0_53CC_4049_865E_85DAAB53B84D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 40dcb7c5c8d4574209908bf29199744854f8c0b2738c2f6948d54c4ce5275b63
#. default-sha256: 44b7c6b269d19cdd49d9794240f745a59e3f4a50cb62327ff75db0b764a08460
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_BCAEF6C0_53CC_4049_865E_85DAAB53B84D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The girl you see, cheerfully picking crimson roses and singing like a songbird, was called "
"Nellie."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫小鳥が囀るように軽やかに歌いながら、⟪k:1⟫深紅のオールドローズを摘む少女を、⟪k:2⟫ネリーといい"
"ました。"

#: scenario:scenario_E7A5DDF4_1895_4A80_A519_9B2F5069A053
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 154a1c74b9736f0eefeeb5d6766c8446e45c88c6d8efedeb0141313fb1e004f8
#. default-sha256: bfbb31eaf6ee030139e85f65cdbae78c70e0456725c0ffcac6918112c5bc5454
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E7A5DDF4_1895_4A80_A519_9B2F5069A053"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Though young, she sang with elegance."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫彼女は幼いながらに、⟪k:1⟫優雅に歌いましたわ。"

#: scenario:scenario_1F54C786_AAE7_4B74_907F_9D590EA3D080
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ee7f79fc8d8870fa21b53299430a5c37bb17ba957d6b267574f65670fa7e7517
#. default-sha256: c98d6391bf24da96e5c799cd1e309bf2ec777781e6729ae136de53806c1e7950
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1F54C786_AAE7_4B74_907F_9D590EA3D080"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nellie was deeply fond of the house’s garden, and she would often spend her afternoons there."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ネリーはお屋敷の庭園が大のお気に入りで、⟪k:1⟫午後は良く出ておりましたの。"

#: scenario:scenario_1F54C786_AAE7_4B74_907F_9D590EA3D079
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2565daff17ed859bccadada7ff5bb389986b09a6a82c3f3dc6c2e5fb9d2e7af4
#. default-sha256: 6ac53afaa25508cabd0c0973297645dd9ffdbc29d055b62eb27bbf220d4a05a7
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1F54C786_AAE7_4B74_907F_9D590EA3D079"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Gorgeous roses gathered from all across the world bloomed in the garden."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫庭園には各国から集められた、⟪k:1⟫美しい薔薇の数々がありましたから。"

#: scenario:scenario_EC6C57EC_D4F8_4A1F_B30C_E07EB8B58D40
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0c5afc9c8e6437ac8382e3800db32336bc52b3daddb2feec1f670b55ece44bf1
#. default-sha256: 064c5dc2248943e1176c146e2b85d126f1ee1198538ea783f160e822db241215
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_EC6C57EC_D4F8_4A1F_B30C_E07EB8B58D40"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫They were given the utmost care, and even had their thorns removed—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫薔薇たちは手入れが行き届いており、⟪k:1⟫棘も抜かれておりました。"

#: scenario:scenario_EAA05CB3_88C5_42E0_84F0_D2378A066978
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 751e806f92bc71d0ee87ece42cd47a471f3a73ca4726ef3b002a2e57755d7649
#. default-sha256: 513a484c0eeca936effbdde196f0f27d45bb72fd067e93310c4e1c7c63bc67b9
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_EAA05CB3_88C5_42E0_84F0_D2378A066978"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫so young Nellie would not hurt herself, naturally."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ええ、⟪k:1⟫もちろん、⟪k:2⟫幼い彼女が触れても傷つかないようにです。"

#: scenario:scenario_9AD3568A_CE83_4EC9_931B_09C984521DFF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cd4339857c13a72e933e7f7c98a818e3c26f1b51a57cb2cd4e4a602901c07831
#. default-sha256: 7d7eba73647d40d1643ed242406c15f84444ce68fcd13e4700608de0e5fca8b8
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_9AD3568A_CE83_4EC9_931B_09C984521DFF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The light-brown-haired girl carefully plucked petals from the roses, gathering them up as "
"she sang."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫穏やかな亜麻色の髪をした少女が、⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫丁寧に、⟪k:3⟫花びらをつまみ、⟪k:4⟫集め、⟪k:5⟫歌"
"う……。"

#: scenario:scenario_06BC61C6_E389_43D4_8C67_096FB58E00E1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a3008f0ca829d36eebb49562614b9b2a07a1989da9bdfea9b2c4b8fdb1a5b3c4
#. default-sha256: 84ce6f7f267e20dd6d3c5f0f7e7e172938f47d5ff183521af47de25704cd60bb
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_06BC61C6_E389_43D4_8C67_096FB58E00E1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Her voice was like music played by faeries—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫nay, the sight of her was like an angel "
"descended from Heaven."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫それはまるで妖精が音を奏でるような、⟪k:1⟫……それか、⟪k:2⟫天使が降りてきたかのような光景でござ"
"いましたわ。"

#: scenario:scenario_33BFA7B0_96A3_45D2_B656_A80E8A602FC7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3f504f244f3d97e7ccc6a9eaa31df4d08a989a43645264af603ffeb1a76129b6
#. default-sha256: bf247078f7c2682ae81a1618afcb364dda3606ea31b9a2beedd148f05fd4a9c6
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_33BFA7B0_96A3_45D2_B656_A80E8A602FC7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Oh dear. Please don’t look at me like that.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I admit I was being rather fanciful..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫あら……いやだ、⟪k:1⟫そんな顔しないでくださいな。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫確かに、わたくし少しばかり、⟪k:4⟫夢"
"見がちでございますけれど……"

#: scenario:scenario_577948E2_4A58_4B2B_9F9F_D1D1E5D12BF7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f694c78abe4b696e64403bc30c25bcb4fcb90a1d6288b41d45de3645c50fc9bc
#. default-sha256: 7629ae9e829c8ddc3591aa12a74f5299c7b7287d1af9664f571a49fa1a8c0216
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_577948E2_4A58_4B2B_9F9F_D1D1E5D12BF7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but what is a woman if not fanciful? Hehe..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫女性とはそういうものではありませんの？⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ふふ……。"

#: scenario:scenario_8C95A494_3B3E_4AE0_BA93_17C85B614917
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f463e2769def52df708a8fd9879ffa2feecb25ffc216838001507417a44843f0
#. default-sha256: 57bdd9c8148212d9a7be4264b39dd944ac184bf7fde348297e0f9b885ba72554
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_8C95A494_3B3E_4AE0_BA93_17C85B614917"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Little bird, little bird, singing night and day.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫For your little birdy heart, "
"sing your woes away.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Pretty flowers all around, all around the little birds.⟪k:6⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ちいさなちいさな小鳥さん、⟪k:1⟫朝も夜も、⟪k:2⟫ふたりのために囀りつづけていてね。⟪k:3⟫きれいな"
"きれいなお花さん、⟪k:4⟫いつでもふたりを包んでいてね……。"

#: scenario:scenario_4BB7DA55_99B4_49EA_BCFD_D2A31E2BB6CC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 85e50969bdad660f6f6cde65a576128bfbdf47e55df0a24028d287c9080a376b
#. default-sha256: f6cc8f0fb8ec47a624284c99db460ba61ec8889c2ffa48323d4e4d85201108a4
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_4BB7DA55_99B4_49EA_BCFD_D2A31E2BB6CC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫And even when the sun comes up...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Umm..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫朝日がのぼっても……、⟪k:1⟫……ええと。"

#: scenario:scenario_9F17AAB9_F6F8_41D4_8B09_1A1C42E81174
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: be9f9eba0ef3250d82cac65313363d91ad26e51675264df2d3be6ec3f109d2d2
