msgctxt "scenario:scenario_48D24DEF_2DA4_4798_9B13_66395CFC917D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫That day, Mell was sitting in the shade of a tree reading a book. ⟪k:1⟫As I am sure you are "
"aware, in their time, books could not yet be mass produced."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫この日、⟪k:1⟫メルは丁度、⟪k:2⟫木陰の下で本を読んでおりました。⟪k:3⟫本、⟪k:4⟫といっても大量に"
"生産出来るものではありません。"

#: scenario:scenario_5FA5021E_D160_466F_8EB1_C05FDA1A31C3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 584876d1e8d08e32a61ac89ae05d445ba0fd2249da7a0247e8209b3641183c33
#. default-sha256: f7e6ad83089ab1ea93560a16e71d0a58ba93cbb934864865489ce37518eb5d10
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_5FA5021E_D160_466F_8EB1_C05FDA1A31C3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What he was reading had been copied by a scribe.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I presume he had borrowed it from "
"the church."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫彼が読む本は、⟪k:1⟫第三者により写本が行われたものでした。⟪k:2⟫きっと教会から借りてきたので"
"しょう。"

#: scenario:scenario_2D9E3BC0_0854_4F34_ABE7_A93B23D50558
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e7452c44f76f0b17b4b18b6302631b0ae7f9f7d94247ec1cea93bc6d8005aac0
