msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mell was a clever boy. ⟪k:1⟫He had attended church from a very young age, where a priest "
"would instruct him in Latin grammar."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫メルは頭の良い少年でした。⟪k:1⟫幼いころから教会に通っては、⟪k:2⟫ラテン語の文法を神父に教わっ"
"ていましたの。"

#: scenario:scenario_4B1407FC_77A8_4A4B_995D_9B1FDDB3075A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5858fbeb9e02596c843d96a359f9cd576affe0b339d8c95fbb0ab0395e328120
