msgid "⟪k:0⟫Though his sister’s shadow overlapped with the tree’s, the boy still did not notice."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫妹の影が木陰とかぶさっても、⟪k:1⟫メルはまだ気付きません。"

#: scenario:scenario_0D4C78FE_9D11_4C02_8080_478D77E7E2B0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9033d230f57ab95db7a247bdb94fcd9eb31a63430502264c2eb92fbb00c26cae
