#: scenario:scenario_30F02EBE_7FBA_42F3_B463_7E00C2B6C8B3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0c31badc2faa83a97883be987e770a93bea0f74dcf785ab0f041fab1634abe28
