msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Hehe. Look, your head is covered in roses, Mell!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫ふふっ、⟪k:4⟫みてみて、⟪k:5⟫おにいさまの髪におはながたくさん！"

#: scenario:scenario_9E14B058_B913_4D7A_AD9D_C76BE1347780
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3c8368d21f9ea14098d24a2bd1d95063b76784f9a737f02070d4adc4f631af0f
